readme.text:
以下为插件真实入口；安装后调用一个即可。

**详细示例** —— 命令 `industry_map`，输入：

~~~sh
industry_map({
  industry: "示例",
  web: false,
  chain: {
    nodes: [
      { id: "up", name: "上游原料", tier: "upstream", metrics: [{ key: "价格", value: 10, unit: "元", asOf: "2026-01-01", sourceRef: "S1" }] },
      { id: "down", name: "下游渠道", tier: "downstream", metrics: [{ key: "占比" }] }
    ],
    edges: [{ from: "up", to: "down" }]
  }
})
~~~

输出：

